# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
#
# The image used to package a prebuilt binary, so this file ignored everything
# (`**`) and re-included only `dist/manager-*`. The Dockerfile is multi-stage
# now and compiles from source in the build stage, so the Go source has to reach
# the build context. Same denylist shape as the other Go repos.
.git
.github
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.md
bin
dist
testbin
config
